Cell["Acknowledgements", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.98613267184507*^9, 
  3.9861326734032383`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"009219fc-2ca1-1d47-b85b-\
dbf8e504a5c8"],

Cell["\<\
\tFirst and foremost, we would like to thank our WELP mentor Megan Davis. \
Megan was incredibly helpful in narrowing the scope of our project, helping \
us understand the intricacies of the Wolfram Language, holding us accountable \
to the goals we set for ourselves, and investing their time and effort to \
guide us through the project overall. We would also like to thank the WELP \
directors Rory Folger and Eryn Gillam for approving our project, introducing \
us to and building our skills in the Wolfram Language as teachers in the \
bootcamp semester of WELP, and helping publish it to the Wolfram community so \
that we can share our simulation package with the world. We are incredibly \
excited to not only continue this project as we describe in the Future Work \
section but also see what creations and experiments the Wolfram Community may \
run with our toolbox.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9893619201416893`*^9, 
  3.989361938017475*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"28b47761-70d0-9f4a-85ae-\
c43a2d801bb1"]
}, Open  ]],

