[BT1] Michael Begon, Colin R. Townsend, and John L. Harper (2006), Ecology: \
From Individuals to Ecosystems, 4th edition, Blackwell Publishing, Oxford.

[BR1] James H. Brown, James F. Gillooly, Andrew P. Allen, Van M. Savage, and \
